{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>While CarPlay was mentioned only once during the WWDC26 keynote, it includes several improvements and, as always, a new set of wallpapers. You can download them below.</p>\n<h2>CarPlay in iOS 27 features a surprisingly extensive wallpaper gallery</h2>\n<p>As we covered here, CarPlay in iOS 27 includes the new Siri AI, introduces support for video apps, adds refreshed app icons, brings UX improvements to media control, and more.</p>\n<p>As expected, CarPlay also gets a new set of wallpapers, featuring the same stylized “27” design seen across the iOS 27, iPadOS 27, and macOS 27 Golden Gate wallpapers.</p>\n<p>However, CarPlay offers a much larger wallpaper selection than its counterparts, with 18 color variants to choose from.</p>\n<p>You can download them below:</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/WallpaperBlue-Dark.jpg?quality=82&amp;strip=all&amp;w=1024\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/WallpaperBlue-Light.jpg?quality=82&amp;strip=all&amp;w=1024\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/WallpaperBrown-Dark.jpg?quality=82&amp;strip=all&amp;w=1024\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/WallpaperBrown-Light.jpg?quality=82&amp;strip=all&amp;w=1024\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/WallpaperDarkBlue-Dark.jpg?quality=82&amp;strip=all&amp;w=1024\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/WallpaperDarkBlue-Light.jpg?quality=82&amp;strip=all&amp;w=1024\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/WallpaperGreen-Dark.jpg?quality=82&amp;strip=all&amp;w=1024\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/WallpaperGreen-Light.jpg?quality=82&amp;strip=all&amp;w=1024\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/WallpaperGrey-Dark.jpg?quality=82&amp;strip=all&amp;w=1024\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/WallpaperGrey-Light.jpg?quality=82&amp;strip=all&amp;w=1024\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/WallpaperHero-Dark.jpg?quality=82&amp;strip=all&amp;w=1024\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/WallpaperHero-Light.jpg?quality=82&amp;strip=all&amp;w=1024\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/WallpaperPurple-Dark.jpg?quality=82&amp;strip=all&amp;w=1024\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/WallpaperPurple-Light.jpg?quality=82&amp;strip=all&amp;w=1024\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/WallpaperRed-Dark.jpg?quality=82&amp;strip=all&amp;w=1024\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/WallpaperRed-Light.jpg?quality=82&amp;strip=all&amp;w=1024\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/WallpaperTeal-Dark.jpg?quality=82&amp;strip=all&amp;w=1024\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/WallpaperTeal-Light.jpg?quality=82&amp;strip=all&amp;w=1024\"/>\n<p>What’s your favorite color variant? Let us know in the comments.</p>\n<h4>Worth checking out on Amazon</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Geoffrey Cain – ‘Steve Jobs in Exile’</li>\n<li>David Pogue – ’Apple: The First 50 Years’</li>\n<li>MacBook Neo</li>\n<li>Logitech MX Master 4</li>\n<li>AirPods Pro 3</li>\n<li>AirTag (2nd Generation) – 4 Pack</li>\n<li>Apple Watch Series 11</li>\n<li>Wireless CarPlay adapter</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-12T22:53:09.523192+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1031,"images":18,"source":"9to5Mac","fallback":"unknown"}}